// 用例目的：两个数组参数长度不一致（couponDates 多一个元素），实测插件宽松接受——记录实际行为
@testing:case="createSnowballAutoCallableNote couponDates length mismatch", exception=1
caplib::createSnowballAutoCallableNote(0.12, 2020.02.21, join(couponDates, couponDates[0]), "ACT_365_FIXED", "UP_OUT", underlyingPrice*1.05, "DOWN_IN", underlyingPrice*0.8, "SELL", "PUT", underlyingPrice, 1.0, underlyingPrice, 2020.08.19, 2020.08.20, 1, 1e6, "CNY", "SPOT", "CNY", "50ETF.SSE", "f_SN", couponDates, couponObsValues, couponObsWeights, dailyObsDates, dailyObsValues, dailyObsWeights, false);
